#: modcrosscheck:rstitle
msgid "Text copied between books"
msgstr ""

#: modcrosscheck:rsdescription
msgid ""
"Finds chunks holding text from another book of the same language: chunks "
"pasted over, blocks of verses, and the end of another book's chunk stuck "
"onto a chunk. Earlier versions in each project's history show which book had "
"the text first and the commit that brought it in (the version before that "
"commit has the chunk's own text). Real parallels are left out by comparing "
"the English ULB. Also reports book titles another book has and chapter "
"titles with the wrong number. With the options below it also compares with "
"other languages: verses pasted or reworded from another language's text, and "
"chunks taken from it. Changes nothing."
msgstr ""

