#: modcrossrepair:rstitle
msgid "Repair copied text"
msgstr ""

#: modcrossrepair:rsdescription
msgid ""
"Puts back chunks that hold text copied from another book (as Text copied "
"between books finds them): a chunk that was there before gets its version "
"from before the damaging commit back, a chunk the damage added is removed. "
"Everything else those commits changed stays. Chunks edited since are left "
"alone. Titles found wrong get an earlier title of their own back (a chapter "
"title its right number). Find, check the chunks to repair, then Check to see "
"what would happen. Upload afterwards with Upload to WACS."
msgstr ""

