#: modlanguagechange:rsdescription
msgid ""
"Gives the checked projects another language code, name or text direction, so "
"that a language's projects agree: BTT-Writer copies these into each project "
"when it is made and never updates them. The manifest is changed and "
"committed, and the folder renamed to match a new code. WACS is not changed: "
"a project with a new code uploads to a repo of its new name, and devices "
"with the old project must import the new one. Find, check the projects, set "
"what they should become, then Check to see what would happen."
msgstr ""

