"Does what BTT-Writer's Update Sources does to its index.sqlite (the list of "
"source texts, their languages and projects, and translationAcademy), "
"downloading many catalogs at once: about half a minute instead of five. The "
"source texts themselves are not downloaded. Reports what changed. BTT-Writer "
