#: modprojects:rsdescription
msgid ""
"Lists the projects in BTT-Writer's projects folder and any problems with "
"them: damaged manifests or git history, unresolved conflicts, and chunks or "
"verse markers that do not match en_ulb or the project's source chunking. Two "
"repairs: projects on git branch main are moved to master, the only branch "
"BTT-Writer uses, and a .git folder that has lost HEAD, config or its index "
"while its history is intact (as a copy can leave it) is rebuilt. Nothing "
"else is changed."
msgstr ""

